 offers hints and highlights to show you how to play chess, how pieces can move, and which could be in danger, making it a perfect chess trainer.<br>- Intuitive 3D Chess Design: Navigate the game easily and get an engaging learning experience.<br>- Undo Moves: The undo feature allows you to take back moves, encouraging exploration and learning from errors.<br>- Progressive Levels: From simple chess levels for beginners to challenging scenarios for advanced players. Improve chess tactics and strategies at your own pace.<br>- Game Phase Mastery: Explore chess Openings, Middles, and Endgames, covering every phase of the game.<br>- Flexibility of Play Anywhere, Anytime: Enjoy chess offline for practice or online to challenge opponents around the globe.<br><br>Whether you like to play chess with friends or want to learn to play chess alone, enjoy 2 player games, or immerse yourself in the chess sport, Easy Chess is your gateway. Dive into one of the most famous classic games in the world, become closer to chess stars, and join a global community of enthusiasts. Enjoy chess lessons that give you the sensation of playing with a chess pro directly through your device for ultimate convenience.<br><br>Welcome to Easy Chess, where learning is as engaging as playing - where you&#39;re not just playing chess, you&#39;re becoming part of the chess tempo of life. Easy Chess is more than just a game; it&#39;s a step into the vast chess universe, designed to teach, challenge, and inspire you to become a real chess master. It&#39;s time to make your move in the world of chess.<br><br>Terms of Use:<br>https://easybrain.com/terms<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://easybrain.com/privacy",
